# The oldest RasBeacon version that can install this version's update file
# (.rbupdate), e.g. v1.0.0. Leave it empty when any version can.
#
# Set it when a new version can't be installed over older ones: say its
# settings or its partitions changed in a way the update can't handle.
# Older RasBeacons then refuse the update and tell their owner to back up
# the settings, flash the new image and restore the backup. See
# docs/releasing.md.
